        "question": "What is the best AI music generator for video?",
        "answer": "For background music under a clip, Lyria 3 and ElevenLabs Music are strong starting points: Lyria 3 costs $0.04 per track on fal and ElevenLabs Music $0.80 per minute with an instrumental switch. For music that follows the cut, use a video-to-music model such as Sonilo. For songs with vocals, use MiniMax Music or Suno."
